WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Two important tips for you. If you have vomited tonight, don't worry.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.880
You didn't vomit your entire prep. Just take extra time drinking it.

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.790
But if you feel you have not had a bowel movement since starting your prep or

4
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.000
you feel you won't be cleaned out by the morning,

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.580
then I recommend you call your doctor's office. They will most likely ask you

6
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.960
to drink a bottle of magnesium citrate.
